DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:bAffectedByGamePause {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamWidgetAnimationComponent.h#DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:bAffectedByGamePause
    src   "Every animation this component plays: keep going while the game is paused.\n\nThe tween side has had this per tween all along (UDreamTweener::affectByGamePause) and a pause\nmenu that animates itself away is the ordinary case for it; the Sequencer side simply had no\nswitch. Off means the engine's own \"tick this client while paused\" path, which also hands the\nplayer the clock that keeps running while paused."
    text  "此组件播放的每个动画：游戏暂停时继续播放。\n\n补间一侧一直按补间提供此项（UDreamTweener::affectByGamePause），而自行播放动画退场的\n暂停菜单正是它的常见情形；Sequencer 一侧则根本没有开关。关闭表示走引擎自带的\n“暂停时仍对此客户端执行 tick”路径，该路径还会把暂停期间持续走的时钟交给\n播放器。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:bAffectedByTimeDilation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamWidgetAnimationComponent.h#DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:bAffectedByTimeDilation
    src   "Every animation this component plays: follow Global Time Dilation.\n\nThe delta the sequence tick manager hands out is already dilated, so this is on by default and a\nbullet-time effect slows the HUD with everything else. Off divides the dilation back out, which\nis the tween side's affectByTimeDilation -- and what a menu that must stay responsive wants."
    text  "此组件播放的每个动画：跟随全局时间膨胀。\n\n序列计时管理器给出的增量已经过膨胀，因此默认开启；\n子弹时间效果会让HUD随其他内容一起变慢。关闭会将膨胀除回去，也就是补间侧的affectByTimeDilation——\n这正是需要保持响应的菜单所需要的。"
    state machine
}

