DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:PlayAnimation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamWidgetAnimationComponent.h#DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:PlayAnimation
    src   "Plays a new instance of an animation without interrupting the ones already running. The\nform the compiler's generated animation variables feed: a graph drags the animation in\ninstead of naming it with a string that goes stale on rename. Accepts this component's\nembedded animations and its standalone sequence assets alike.\n@param StartAtTime Seconds into the animation to start from; for a reverse play, seconds before its end.\n@param NumLoopsToPlay Total number of times to play the animation. Zero loops indefinitely, matching UMG; so does any negative number, for callers who spell \"forever\" as -1."
    text  "播放动画的一个新实例，不中断已在运行的实例。\n这是编译器生成的动画变量所馈送的形式：图表将动画拖入，\n而不是用一个在重命名后就会失效的字符串来命名它。接受此组件\n内嵌的动画及其独立的序列资产。\n@param StartAtTime 从动画的第几秒开始播放；对于反向播放，指其结束前几秒。\n@param NumLoopsToPlay 播放动画的总次数。为零时无限循环，与 UMG 一致；任何负数也是如此，供将“永远”写作 -1 的调用方使用。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:PlayAnimationForward {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Animation/DreamWidgetAnimationComponent.h#DreamWidgetAnimationComponent:PlayAnimationForward
    src   "Plays an animation forward relative to its current state: an instance already running or\npaused turns around from where it is, otherwise a new one starts from the beginning. The\n\"panel slides out on click, slides back on the next click\" idiom, exactly as in UMG."
    text  "相对于当前状态正向播放动画：已在运行或\n已暂停的实例从当前位置转向，否则新实例从头开始。\n即“点击时面板滑出，下次点击时滑回”的惯用法，与 UMG 完全一致。"
    state machine
}

